Package: imv
Version: @DEB_IMV_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: X11/Wayland Apps
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://sr.ht/~exec64/imv/
Depends: libwayland0, libxkbcommon0, libx11-6, libxcb1, libgl1, angle, libpango-1.0-0, libcairo2, libglib2.0-0, libpng16-16, libturbojpeg0
Description: Command-line image viewer for Wayland/X11
 imv is a fast, configurable image viewer. This build includes the native
 Wayland backend and the X11 backend for Xwayland fallback, with libpng and
 libjpeg-turbo image support, pangocairo text overlay, and libgrapheme Unicode
 segmentation.
